# Same convention as qa-artifacts/MEH-2108/.gitignore, and for the same reason:
# the harness writes PNG, scripts/compress-qa-screenshots.mjs converts each to
# the .webp committed beside it, so every PNG here duplicates tracked evidence
# and a full sweep's PNGs would breach the 2 MB "qa-artifacts size cap" required
# job (MEH-1156).
*.png

# Control-demo and re-verification output, deliberately NOT part of the evidence
# set. probe-* came from deliberately breaking a control to show it fails;
# recheck-* is a repeat of a measurement already represented by before-/after-.
# Committing either invites a later reader to treat a broken-on-purpose run as a
# finding.
probe-*
recheck-*
